# Send Email Invitation for "Invite User" Button

This task adds functionality to send an email invitation when an Admin clicks the "Invite User" button on the Users page.

## User Review Required

> [!WARNING]
> We need to decide how to handle email sending. The backend currently has no mailer configured. I propose using Python's standard `smtplib` and `email.message` for sending SMTP emails, which avoids introducing external dependencies.
> 
> Also, currently the "Users" list returns mock data. Should the invite flow create a real user record with a "Pending" status in the database, or just send an email? (I propose creating a Pending user in the DB so it shows up in the Users list, if the Users list is updated to fetch from DB).

